 "夢を結ぶ": "نَامَ, رَقَدَ (To rest in a state of reduced consciousness.) / نَوْم, سِنَة (The state of reduced consciousness during which a human or animal rests in a dai) / نَوْمَة (An act or instance of sleeping.) / غَمَص, رَمَص (Rheum, crusty or gummy discharge found in the corner of the eyes after waking, w)  [to sleep]",
