 "失う": "فَقَدَ (To cease to have (something) in one's possession or capability.) / خَسِرَ (To become a defeated competitor in (a game, competition, trial, etc).) / خَسِرَ (To be defeated (in a game, competition, contest, etc.))  [to lose]\nمثال: ミスで財産を失った。\n→ My mistake cost me my fortune. / أَخْطَأَ (To fail to hit, catch, grasp, etc.) / فَاتَ (To fail to experience, attend, partake, take advantage of, etc.) / اِفْتَقَدَ, اِشْتَاقَ (To become aware of the loss or absence of; to feel the want or need of, sometime) / آنِسَة (An unmarried woman; a girl.)  [to miss (a chance, opportunity)] / فَقَدَ (To cease to have (something) in one's possession or capability.) / خَسِرَ (To become a defeated competitor in (a game, competition, trial, etc).) / خَسِرَ (To be defeated (in a game, competition, contest, etc.))  [to lose (a loved one)] / [to concede (goals, points, etc.)]",
 "失す": "اِخْتَفَى (To vanish.) / أَخْفَى (To make vanish; especially, to abduct or murder for political reasons.)  [to disappear] / ذَهَبَ, رَاحَ (To move, either physically or in an abstract sense:) / ذَهَبَ, زَالَ (To pass, to be used up:) / غُو (A strategic board game, originally from China and today also popular in Japan an)  [to go] / مَاتَ (to stop living) / تُوُفِّيَ (to stop living) / زَهْر اَلطَّاوِلَة, زَهْر اَلنَّرْد (An isohedral polyhedron, usually a cube, with numbers or symbols on each side an)  [to die]",
 "失する": "فَقَدَ (To cease to have (something) in one's possession or capability.) / خَسِرَ (To become a defeated competitor in (a game, competition, trial, etc).) / خَسِرَ (To be defeated (in a game, competition, contest, etc.))  [to lose]",
 "失せる": "اِخْتَفَى (To vanish.) / أَخْفَى (To make vanish; especially, to abduct or murder for political reasons.)  [to disappear] / ذَهَبَ, رَاحَ (To move, either physically or in an abstract sense:) / ذَهَبَ, زَالَ (To pass, to be used up:) / غُو (A strategic board game, originally from China and today also popular in Japan an)  [to go] / مَاتَ (to stop living) / تُوُفِّيَ (to stop living) / زَهْر اَلطَّاوِلَة, زَهْر اَلنَّرْد (An isohedral polyhedron, usually a cube, with numbers or symbols on each side an)  [to die]",
 "失せ去る": "اِخْتَفَى (To vanish.) / أَخْفَى (To make vanish; especially, to abduct or murder for political reasons.)  [to disappear]",
