 "如何様": "غِشّ, اِحْتِيال (Any act of deception carried out for the purpose of unfair, undeserved or unlawf)  [fraud]\nمثال: 何回もいかさまにだまされましたよ。\n→ I got sucked in on a lot of phony deals. / بِالتَّأْكِيد (Certainly, undoubtedly.)  [surely]",
