 "始め": "بِدَايَة (The act of doing that which begins anything; commencement of an action, state, o) / بِدَايَة (That which begins or originates something; the source or first cause.) / بِدَايَة (The initial portion of some extended thing.)  [beginning]\nمثال: 旅行の初めの二日間は雨降りだった。\n→ The first two days of my trip were rainy. / أَوَّل, أُولَى (Coming right after the zeroth in things that use zero-based numbering.) / أَوَّلاً (Before anything else; firstly.) / أَوَّل (The person or thing in the first position.)  [first (in line, etc.)]\nesp. 初め / مَنْشَأ (The beginning of something.) / مَنْبَع, مَنْشَأ (The source of a river, information, goods, etc.) / اَصْل (Ancestry.)  [origin]\nesp. 始め / [such as ... ; not to mention ...]\nesp. 始め; as 〜を始め, 〜を始めとして, etc.\nمثال: この語学センターでは、英語をはじめ世界１５か国の外国語が学べる。\n→ At this language centre, about 15 international languages are taught, including English.",
