 "定か": "مَعْرِفَة (Designating an identified or immediately identifiable person or thing, or group )  [definite]\nمثال: 船田氏が新党に加わるかどうかは、定かでは、ない。\n→ It is not certain if Mr Funada will join the new party.",
 "定まり": "قَانُون, قَاعِدَة (A regulation, law, guideline.) / حُكْم, حُكُومَة (The act of ruling; administration of law; government; empire; authority; control) / حَكَمَ (To regulate, be in charge of, make decisions for, reign over.)  [rule]",
 "定む": "قَرَّرَ, صَمَّمَ (To resolve (a contest, problem, dispute, etc.); to choose, determine, or settle.) / قَرَّرَ (To make a judgment, especially after deliberation.)  [to decide] / وَصَفَ (To order (a drug or medical device) for use by a particular patient (under licen) / أَمَرَ (To specify by writing as a required procedure or ritual; to lay down authoritati)  [to prescribe] / [to bring peace (to) ; to make peaceful]",
 "定め": "قَانُون, حُقُوق (A rule, such as:) / قَانُون (A rule, such as:)  [law]\nمثال: この定めから逃れないといけない。\n→ I need to escape from this decree. / قِسْمَة, مَصِير (The presumed cause, force, principle, or divine will that predetermines events.)  [fate]",
