 "定める": "قَرَّرَ, صَمَّمَ (To resolve (a contest, problem, dispute, etc.); to choose, determine, or settle.) / قَرَّرَ (To make a judgment, especially after deliberation.)  [to decide]\nمثال: ヘーゲルと同様に、パノフスキーの弁論方の概念は歴史があらかじめ定められた道程をたどるようにさせている。\n→ In the same way as Hegel, Panovsky's notion of the dialectic makes history follow a predetermined course. / وَصَفَ (To order (a drug or medical device) for use by a particular patient (under licen) / أَمَرَ (To specify by writing as a required procedure or ritual; to lay down authoritati)  [to prescribe]\nمثال: 職員の選考に関する規則を次のように定める。\n→ Rules in connection with staff selection are set as follows. / [to bring peace (to) ; to make peaceful]",
