 "密": "كَثِيف, غَلِيظ (Having relatively high density.)  [dense]\nمثال: からだ全体が密に毛でおおわれている。\n→ The entire body is densely covered with hair. / أَغْلَقَ, سَكَّر (To remove or block an opening, gap or passage through.) / قَرِيب (Having little difference or distance in place, position, or abstractly; see also)  [close (relationship)] / دَقِيقَة, دِقيقة (A unit of time which is one sixtieth of an hour (sixty seconds).) / لَحْظَة (A while or a long unspecified period of time.) / دَقِيقٌ, تَافِهٌ (Very small.)  [minute] / سِرّ, خَفِيَّة (A piece of knowledge that is hidden and intended to be kept hidden.) / سِرِّيّ (Being or kept hidden.)  [secret]",
