 "密告": "مَعْلُومَات, مَعْلُومَة (Things that are or can be known about a given topic; communicable knowledge of s)  [(secret) information]\nمثال: スリの一人は残りの二人を密告した。\n→ One of the pickpockets blew the whistle on the other two.",
 "密告者": "مُخْبِر, مُخْبِرة (One who relays confidential information to someone, especially to the police; an) / مُخْبِر (A native speaker who acts as a linguistic reference for a language being studied)  [informant]",
