 "対": "فِي مُقَابِل, ضِِدَّ (Against; in opposition to.) / عَلَى اَلْعَكْس, ضِِدَّ (Compared with, as opposed to.)  [versus]\nمثال: 今日早稲田対慶応の試合がある。\n→ There is going to be a game between Waseda and Keio today. / أَنّ (A particle used for marking the following verb as an infinitive.) / إِلَى, عَلَى (Indicating destination or final position: In the direction of, so as to arrive a)  [to (e.g. score of 4 to 2, ratio of 3 to 1, vote of 320 to 180)]\nused between numbers\nمثال: 試合は6対6で引き分けに終わった。\n→ The match ended in a 6-6 draw. / [toward ... ; to ...]\nمثال: 同社の昨年の対インド輸出は１億ドルに達した。\n→ The company's exports to India amounted to $100 million last year. / [equal footing ; equal terms]",
