 "対当": "مقابلة (The apparent relative position of two celestial bodies when one is at an angle o) / مُعَارَضَة, مُقَاوَمَة (A political party or movement opposed to the party or government in power.) / تَنَاقُضْ (The difference of quantity or quality between two propositions having the same s)  [opposition]",
 "対応": "مُرَاسَلَة (Mutual communication or discourse:)  [correspondence (to)]\nمثال: その日本語に対応する英語はない。\n→ That Japanese word has no equivalent in English. / مُبَارَاة (Any contest or trial of strength or skill, or to determine superiority.) / شَحّاطَة, شَخَّاطَة (Synonym of fuse, a long wick used to transfer flame to an explosive device.)  [matching]\nمثال: われわれは教育の方法を時代に対応しなければならない。\n→ We have to bring our teaching methods up to date. / مِقْبَض (The part of an object which is (designed to be) held in the hand when used or mo)  [handling]\nمثال: 私は敵意をもったまでも、冷ややかな対応を受けた。\n→ I met with a cool, not to say hostile, reception. / دَعَمَ, دَعَّمَ (To help keep from falling.) / أَيَّدَ, دَعَمَ (To back or favor a cause, party, etc., mentally or with concrete aid) / تَأْيِيد, دَعْم (Financial or other help.)  [support (for)]\nمثال: Windows95対応のゲームを動かしたいのです。\n→ I want to run a Windows 95 game.",
