 "封緘": "فُقْمَة (A pinniped (Pinnipedia), particularly an earless seal (true seal) or eared seal.) / خَتْم (A stamp used to impress a design on a soft substance such as wax.) / خَتْم (A facsimile of an impression of such stamp that is a mark or symbol of an office)  [seal (letters, documents, etc.)]",
