 "専": "[exclusively doing ... ; person who exclusively does ...] / أَوَّل, أُولَى (Coming right after the zeroth in things that use zero-based numbering.) / أَوَّلاً (Before anything else; firstly.) / أَوَّل (The person or thing in the first position.)  [first]",
