 "専門分野": "حَقْل (A region containing a particular mineral.) / سَاحَة, سَاحَة الْمَعْرَكَة (A place where competitive matches are carried out.) / مَجَال (Any of various figurative meanings, often dead metaphors.)  [(one's) field]",
 "専門医": "مُتَخَصِّص, مُتَخَصِّصَة (Someone who is an expert in, or devoted to, some specific branch of study or res)  [(medical) specialist]\nمثال: 私たちは、ブラウン博士を合衆国で最高の心臓病の専門医とみなしている。\n→ We regard Dr. Brown as the best heart specialist in the United States.",
