 "届く": "بَلَغَ (To extend, stretch, or thrust out (for example a limb or object held in the hand)  [to reach]\nمثال: 彼女の声は騒音でよく届かなかった。\n→ Her voice did not carry well over the noise. / وَصَلَ (To reach; to get to a certain place.)  [to arrive]\nمثال: 私あての手紙は届いていますか？\n→ Have any letters arrived for me? / [to be attentive ; to be scrupulous]\nas 目が届く, 神経が届く, etc.\nمثال: ここからでも声は届くよ。\n→ You can make yourself heard even from here. / [to be realized (of a desire) ; to be fulfilled]",
