 "差し覗く": "بَدَا (To appear, to seem.) / نَظْرَة, نَظْرَة (The action of looking; an attempt to see.) / مَرْأىً, مَرْآة (Physical appearance, visual impression.)  [to look (into)] / [to stop by ; to drop in]",
 "差し許す": "سَمَحَ, أَذِنَ (To let one have as a suitable share of something.) / سَمَحَ بِـ, سَمَحَ (To permit, to give permission to.)  [to allow]",
 "差し詰め": "فِي النِّهَايَة (Anyway, in any case; indicates a statement is true regardless of other considera)  [after all]\nمثال: みなプロジェクトを抱えているので、差し詰め、君しか適任者はいない。\n→ Everybody has their own projects on, so after all you are the only suitable candidate. / [for the time being ; at present]\nمثال: 会社をクビになったけど、貯金がすこしあるので、差し詰め生活には困らない。\n→ I got the sack but I've a little saved up, so for the time being I won't be troubled by living expenses.",
 "差し越す": "أَرْسَلَ, بَعَثَ (To make something (such as an object or message) go from one place to another (o)  [to send]",
 "差し込み": "[insertion] / قَابِس (electric connecting device) / فِيشَة (electric connecting device) / بُوجِيه (hole filler) / دِسَام (hole filler) / سِدَاد (hole filler) / سِدَادَة (hole filler)  [plug] / اِخْتِلَاج (An intense, paroxysmal, involuntary muscular contraction.)  [(fit of) convulsions]",
 "差し込み口": "قَابِس (electric connecting device) / فِيشَة (electric connecting device) / بُوجِيه (hole filler) / دِسَام (hole filler) / سِدَاد (hole filler) / سِدَادَة (hole filler)  [plug]",
 "差し込む": "أَدْخَلَ (To put in between or into.)  [to insert]\nمثال: しかもなお、石の大きいブロックが非常にぴったりと合わさっているので、ブロックの間にナイフの先を差し込むことができない。\n→ And yet the large blocks of stone are fitted together so closely that you cannot put in the point of a knife between them. / [to come in (of light) ; to shine in]\nalso written as 射し込む / [to have a griping pain (in the stomach, chest, etc.)]\nمثال: こんもりと茂った木々の葉を通して日光が差し込んだ。\n→ The sunshine penetrated the thick leaves of the trees.",
 "差し金": "[carpenter's square]\nalso written as 指矩 / اِقْتِرَاح, مُقْتَرَح (Something suggested (with subsequent adposition being for))  [suggestion] / [metal wire with a prop animal (e.g. butterfly, bird) attached to the end] / [rod used to control the arm of a puppet (in bunraku)]",
 "差し障り": "عَقَبَة, حَاجِز (Something that impedes, stands in the way of, or holds up progress, either physi)  [obstacle] / إِزْعَاج (That which annoys.)  [annoyance (to others)]",
 "差し障る": "عَاقَ, عَرْقَلَ (To make difficult to accomplish; to act as an obstacle; to frustrate.) / عَاقَ, عَرْقَلَ (To delay or impede; to keep back, to prevent.) / خَلْفِيّ (comparative form of hind: more hind) / رِدْف, عَجِيزَة (The buttocks.)  [to hinder]",
 "差し響く": "نَفُوذ, تَأْثِير (The power to affect, control or manipulate something or someone; the ability to ) / تَأْثِير (An action exerted by a person or thing with such power on another to cause chang) / أَثَّرَ (To have an effect on by using gentle or subtle action; to exert an influence upo)  [to influence]",
 "差す": "لَمَعَ, وَمَضَ (To emit or reflect light so as to glow.)  [to shine] / [to be visible] / [to be tinged with]\nمثال: ほお紅や口紅を差すだけで表情や笑顔がどんどん変わってくるんです。\n→ Expressions and smiles change like that just from applying rouge and lipstick. / نَهَضَ, اِرْتَفْعَ (To move, or appear to move, physically upwards relative to the ground.) / أَشْرَقَ, شَرَقَ (To move, or appear to move, physically upwards relative to the ground.)  [to rise (of water levels)]",
 "差をつける": "[to establish a lead] / مَيَّزَ (To set apart as being different; to mark as different; to separate from another )  [to discriminate]",
 "差を付ける": "[to establish a lead] / مَيَّزَ (To set apart as being different; to mark as different; to separate from another )  [to discriminate]",
 "差上げる": "رَفَعَ (To elevate to a higher position.)  [to lift up]\nمثال: 彼はトロフィーを高々と差し上げた。\n→ He held the trophy up high. / أَعْطَى, وَهَبَ (To move, shift, provide something abstract or concrete to someone or something o)  [to give]\nمثال: 飲み物を差し上げましょうか。\n→ May I offer you a drink? / فَعَلَ, عَمِلَ (To perform; to execute.) / دُو, دُو (A syllable used in solfège to represent the first and eighth tonic of a major sc)  [to do (for someone)]\nafter -te form of verb; more respectful than 〜して上げる",
 "差上る": "نَهَضَ, اِرْتَفْعَ (To move, or appear to move, physically upwards relative to the ground.) / أَشْرَقَ, شَرَقَ (To move, or appear to move, physically upwards relative to the ground.)  [to rise (e.g. sun, moon)]",
 "差交す": "صَلِيب (A geometrical figure consisting of two straight lines or bars intersecting each ) / صَلِيب (A wooden post with a perpendicular beam attached and used (especially in the Rom) / صَلِيب (Alternative letter-case form of Cross (“the Crucifix, the cross on which Christ ) / عَبْر, خِلَال (The cross product of the previous vector and the following vector.) / عَبَرَ (To move relatively.)  [to cross]",
 "差交わす": "صَلِيب (A geometrical figure consisting of two straight lines or bars intersecting each ) / صَلِيب (A wooden post with a perpendicular beam attached and used (especially in the Rom) / صَلِيب (Alternative letter-case form of Cross (“the Crucifix, the cross on which Christ ) / عَبْر, خِلَال (The cross product of the previous vector and the following vector.) / عَبَرَ (To move relatively.)  [to cross]",
 "差付ける": "نُقْطَة (A small dot or mark.) / نُقْطَة (A small discrete division or individual feature of something.) / مَوْقِع (A small discrete division or individual feature of something.) / أَشَارَ (To extend the index finger in the direction of something in order to show where )  [to point (gun at)]",
 "差伸べる": "تَمَدَّدَ (To lengthen by pulling.) / مَدَّدَ, اِمْتَدَّ (To extend one’s limbs or another part of the body, for example in order to impro)  [to stretch] / [to thrust (javelin)] / اِقْتِرَاح (A proposal that has been made.) / اِقْتَرَحَ, قَدَّمَ (To propose or express one's willingness (to do something).) / قَدَّمَ (To present (something) to God or gods, as a gesture of worship or as a sacrifice)  [to offer (e.g. aid, help, etc.)]\nمثال: 私が出来る限りの援助を彼に差しのべるつもりです。\n→ I'll offer him what help I can.",
 "差傘": "مِظَلَّة, شَمْسِيَّة (A cloth-covered frame used for protection against rain or sun.) / وَاقٍ, الْوَاقِي (Anything that provides similar protection.)  [umbrella]"
}
